The user will ask something like: "I need to prepare internal financial materials. Our company Stellar Labs has $2.1M cash, 20 months runway, burn rate $240K/month, and revenue last quarter $3.2M. Can you help me with customer acquisit..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


