To help you calculate the Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC) and Lifetime Value (LTV) for Stellar Labs and build a strong finance narrative, I will need a few more specific data points. The high-level metrics you provided (cash, runway, burn rate, and revenue) are great for the overall picture, but CAC and LTV require unit-level economics.

**To calculate Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC), please provide:**
