*   **Formula:** Average Revenue Per User (ARPU) × Gross Margin % / Customer Churn Rate.
*   *What I need from you:* What is your average revenue per customer, your gross margin, and your estimated churn rate (or average customer lifespan)?

**Current Financial Narrative Snapshot:**
