*   **Revenue:** Generating $3.2M in the last quarter shows strong top-line performance. 

Once you provide the sales, marketing, and customer retention numbers, we can calculate your CAC and LTV. A strong LTV:CAC ratio (typically 3:1 or higher is the gold standard for SaaS/tech) combined with your 20-month runway will make for a very compelling internal financial narrative!

